     - 0.647°C = 5.025°C kg/mol * (0.6216 g / M_u) * (1 kg / 0.050 kg)
     - 0.647°C = 62.16 g/mol / M_u

   - Solve for M_u:
     - M_u = 62.16 g/mol / 0.647°C
     - M_u = 96.0 g/mol

