"How can the properties of polymer-based smart materials be tuned or adjusted to respond to specific stimuli such as temperature, pH, or light?","<bos><start_of_turn>user
How can the properties of polymer-based smart materials be tuned or adjusted to respond to specific stimuli such as temperature, pH, or light?<end_of_turn>
