   \mu_n(A) & \text{if } A \subseteq C \\
   0 & \text{if } A \not\subseteq C
   \end{bmatrix}
   \]  
3. Define \( \mu \times \delta_0 \) similarly:  
   \[
   (\mu \times \delta_0)(A) = \begin{arrayc}
   \mu(A) & \text{if } A \subseteq C \\
   0 & \text{if} A \not\subseteq C
   \end{{align*}
