","The refractive index \( n \) is given by the ratio of the speed of light in a vacuum \( c \) to the speed of light in the medium \( v \):  
\[
n = \frac{c}{v}
\]  
Given that the speed of light in the plastic is \( 0.680 \) times the speed of light in a vacuum, \( v = 0.680c \). Substituting into the formula:  
\[
n = \frac{c}{0.680c} = \frac{1}{0.680} \approx 1.47
\]  
Thus, the refractive index is \(\boxed{1.47}\).",relevance,"# Task Description
