[C₂H₅OH] = 0.667 M
[CH₃COOC₂H₅] = 0.667 M
[H₂O] = 0.667 M

The equilibrium constant (K) for this reaction is given by:

K = [CH₃COOC₂H₅][H₂O] / [CH₃COOH][C₂H₅OH]

K = (0.667)(0.667) / (0.333)(0.667)

